msgid "2D MHD Test: Orszag-Tang Vortex"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Orszag-Tang渦問題 {cite}`orszag_1979JFM....90..129O` は、磁気流体力学（MHD）コードの標準的なテスト問題です。この問題は、磁化された媒体における2つの渦流の相互作用を含み、複雑な構造と乱流を形成します。"
msgstr "The Orszag-Tang vortex problem {cite}`orszag_1979JFM....90..129O` is a standard test problem for magnetohydrodynamics (MHD) codes. This problem involves the interaction of two vortices in a magnetized medium, and forms complex structures and turbulence."

msgid "Location"
msgstr ""

msgid "`demo/mhd2d_vortex/`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Geometry"
msgstr ""

msgid "$0 \\leq x \\leq 1$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$0 \\leq y \\leq 1$."
msgstr ""

msgid "Initial Conditions"
msgstr ""

msgid "初期条件は以下のように設定されます。比熱比は$\\gamma = 5/3$とします。"
msgstr "The initial condition is set as follows. The ratio of specific heats is $\\gamma = 5/3$."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{align*}\n"
"\\rho &= 1, \\\\\n"
"p &= \\frac{1}{\\gamma}, \\\\\n"
"v_x &= -v_0 \\sin(2\\pi y), \\\\\n"
"v_y & = v_0 \\sin(2\\pi x), \\\\\n"
"v_z & = 0, \\\\\n"
"B_x & = B_0 \\sin(2\\pi y),\\\\\n"
"B_y & = B_0 \\sin(4\\pi x),\\\\\n"
"B_z & = 0,\n"
"\\end{align*}\n"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "ここで$v_0 = 1$、$B_0 = \\sqrt{4\\pi}/\\gamma$です。"
msgstr "Here $v_0 = 1$ and $B_0 = \\sqrt{4\\pi}/\\gamma$."

msgid "Boundary Conditions"
msgstr ""

msgid "周期境界条件を全ての境界に対して全ての物理量に設定します。"
msgstr "A periodic boundary condition is imposed on all variables at all boundaries."

msgid "Results"
msgstr ""

msgid "可視化用のPythonスクリプトが用意されています。 結果のプロットは `demo/mhd2d_vortex/figs` に保存されます。"
msgstr "A Python script for visualization is provided. The plots of the results are saved in `demo/mhd2d_vortex/figs`."

